id: pm-csv-21ik
title: loadAppliedByTransaction comment describes unsafe pre-fix marker ordering
description: "CodeRabbit exact-head review of PR 73 found that the resume-invariant comment still said compensateCreate strips ownership markers before closing, contradicting the corrected close-before-cleanup implementation and teaching the unsafe order that loses orphan identity."
